# Style tokens

Use CSS custom properties for shared design tokens. Do not introduce Less `@` variables.

- Define tokens on `:root` in `src/styles/style.less` (layout/sizing) or `src/styles/colors.less` (theme colors).
- Reference tokens with `var(--token-name)` in stylesheets.
- Prefer `rem` for sizing tokens so width does not depend on the consuming element's font size.

```less
// ❌ BAD
@board-width: clamp(16em, 90vw, 30em);
.game-header { width: @board-width; }

// ✅ GOOD
.game-header { width: var(--board-width); }
```
